<title>USA: Proffitt's Nov same-store sales rise 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Proffitt's Nov same-store sales rise 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	 $ 209.1    $ 132.7	 +58	 +7</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four    weeks ended  Nov 30.</p>
<p>Full company name is  Proffitt's Inc</p>
<p>NOTE - Total sales of $209.1 million include $69.9 million of sales from Parisian Inc, with whom Proffitt's merged on October 11. Same-stores figures exclude Parisian.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610.</p>
</text>
